SITION: quiet mic click"},{["kind"]="mic",["pos"]=2597.73,["dur"]=0.19,["source"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_mic_unmute_click.wav",["gain"]=0.06,["name"]="ACT SCENE TRANSITION: quiet mic click"},{["kind"]="mic",["pos"]=2876.994,["dur"]=0.19,["source"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_mic_unmute_click.wav",["gain"]=0.06,["name"]="ACT SCENE TRANSITION: quiet mic click"},{["kind"]="mic",["pos"]=3429.095,["dur"]=0.19,["source"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_mic_unmute_click.wav",["gain"]=0.06,["name"]="ACT SCENE TRANSITION: quiet mic click"},{["kind"]="mic",["pos"]=3933.982,["dur"]=0.19,["source"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_mic_unmute_click.wav",["gain"]=0.06,["name"]="ACT SCENE TRANSITION: quiet mic click"},{["kind"]="mic",["pos"]=4110.67,["dur"]=0.19,["source"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_mic_unmute_click.wav",["gain"]=0.06,["name"]="ACT SCENE TRANSITION: quiet mic click"},{["kind"]="mic",["pos"]=4435.383,["dur"]=0.19,["source"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_mic_unmute_click.wav",["gain"]=0.06,["name"]="ACT SCENE TRANSITION: quiet mic click"}},["sentences"]={{["cue_index"]=3,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=7.66,["end"]=9.912,["text"]="That's Angela Maggard.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=4,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=10.212,["end"]=18.95,["text"]="She said that into an open microphone on X—in a live audio room she had titled Logan Black Unmasked.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=6,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=19.75,["end"]=22.002,["text"]="I'm Logan Black.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=7,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=22.301,["end"]=39.958,["text"]="When Angela hosted that broadcast in September of 2026, she was speaking to hundreds of listeners in an online audio community where she had spent the last two years building a following as a whistle-blower and a fierce advocate for trauma survivors.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=8,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=40.258,["end"]=51.834,["text"]="Over the course of that afternoon—and across weeks of broadcasts that surrounded it—she turned her microphone on me, and on the people closest to me.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=20,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=159.954,["end"]=170.314,["text"]="If you tuned into those broadcasts as a stranger, you would think Angela was confronting an enemy she had been tracking from a distance.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=21,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=170.614,["end"]=179.352,["text"]="What you wouldn't know is that for more than two years before that broadcast, Angela and I were friends.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=22,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=179.652,["end"]=185.067,["text"]="Here is how Angela herself described our history just ten days earlier:",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=25,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=233.047,["end"]=244.623,["text"]="When Angela entered our community, she presented herself as a protector of vulnerable people—someone who fought for abused women and children and stood up to bullies.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=26,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=244.923,["end"]=246.494,["text"]="People trusted her.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=26,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=246.494,["end"]=248.065,["text"]="I trusted her.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=27,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=248.365,["end"]=251.833,["text"]="And so did a woman named Sav.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=28,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=252.133,["end"]=259.16,["text"]="Sav was a mother who had become one of Angela's closest friends in our online community.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=28,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=259.16,["end"]=266.627,["text"]="They talked regularly about their children, their personal struggles, and the things going on in their lives.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=29,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=266.927,["end"]=271.488,["text"]="Sav believed she had found someone she could confide in.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=29,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=271.488,["end"]=273.313,["text"]="Someone who understood her.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=30,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=273.613,["end"]=280.324,["text"]="And like me, she had no idea how much that trust would eventually cost her.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=31,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=280.624,["end"]=290.492,["text"]="When Angela turned on us in September, I started going through the recordings from thirty-five public broadcasts and the private messages behind them.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=31,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=290.492,["end"]=302.415,["text"]="I also started talking to the people Angela had been close to before us—people whose warnings I had dismissed when Angela and I were still on good terms.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=32,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=302.715,["end"]=309.021,["text"]="And as I laid the recordings out in chronological order, two things became clear.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=33,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=309.321,["end"]=314.338,["text"]="First, what happened to Sav and me wasn't a one-off argument.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=33,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=314.338,["end"]=332.734,["text"]="Multiple former friends and associates across the community described the same experience: trusting Angela as a friend and advocate, confiding private struggles or family details to her, and later watching those confidences used to humiliate, intimidate, or retaliate against them when the relationship soured.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=34,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=333.033,["end"]=348.663,["text"]="And second: whenever Angela's conduct was challenged, she had a story ready to explain why she was actually the victim—why she had been silenced, cornered, or forced to act in order to protect someone else.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=36,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=359.243,["end"]=368.746,["text"]="Because Angela recorded herself talking for hundreds of hours across public rooms, we don't have to take her explanations at face value.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=36,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=368.746,["end"]=377.385,["text"]="We can test what she claimed against what she actually said, what she admitted doing, and what the record shows.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=37,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=377.686,["end"]=383.506,["text"]="In fact, Angela gave the audience her own invitation to do exactly that:",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=39,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=424.386,["end"]=424.977,["text"]="Alright.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=39,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=424.977,["end"]=427.934,["text"]="Let's go through the evidence.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="PROLOGUE: real words and archive exposed until the signature reveal",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=42,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="PROLOGUE — THE PERSON ON THE OTHER END OF THE LINE",["start"]=462.614,["end"]=465.271,["text"]="This is The Paper Trail.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=45,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=466.571,["end"]=478.958,["text"]="If you've never spent time in an X Space late at night, the easiest way to picture it is an open phone line that never really hangs up.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=46,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=479.258,["end"]=483.48,["text"]="Somebody's sitting in a parked car after a night shift.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=46,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=483.48,["end"]=491.079,["text"]="Somebody else is folding laundry in their living room or walking the dog at two in the morning.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=46,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=491.079,["end"]=495.301,["text"]="A dozen people might be listening, or a few hundred.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=46,["sentence_index"]=3,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=495.301,["end"]=511.344,["text"]="The title on the screen might say UFO disclosure or government corruption, but within twenty minutes, people are talking about their divorces, their kids, their money troubles, or the worst thing that ever happened to them growing up.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=47,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=511.644,["end"]=515.293,["text"]="You hear the same voices night after night.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=47,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=515.293,["end"]=521.678,["text"]="And before long, you feel like you know people you've never laid eyes on.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=49,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=522.478,["end"]=528.378,["text"]="That was the world where I first met Angela back in late 2023.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=50,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=528.678,["end"]=536.862,["text"]="When she came up to the microphone, she spoke using her real name, from North Carolina, near Fort Bragg.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=50,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=536.862,["end"]=540.739,["text"]="And she told a story that stopped rooms cold.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=53,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=583.32,["end"]=587.876,["text"]="In other recordings, Angela described further experiences that I cannot independently verify.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=53,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=587.876,["end"]=608.76,["text"]="She claimed she had been illegally adopted into a CIA mind-control program (`AQ-0011`), tortured as a child at Wright-Patterson Air Force Base, and that she had personally helped law enforcement track down a kidnapped thirteen-year-old girl in New York using only a first name and an Xbox account (`AQ-0195`).",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=54,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=609.059,["end"]=618.878,["text"]="Later on, some of her former friends would allege on the record that she fabricated key parts of her personal history (`AQ-0206`, `AQ-0209`).",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=54,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=618.878,["end"]=624.769,["text"]="Angela insisted every word was real and dared critics to prove her wrong (`AQ-0056`).",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=55,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=625.069,["end"]=630.395,["text"]="When I first got to know her, I was not investigating her childhood.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=55,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=630.395,["end"]=639.408,["text"]="Someone says they survived something awful and want to protect children, and your instinct in a late-night conversation is to listen.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=55,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=639.408,["end"]=661.94,["text"]="And when Angela talked about why she kept meticulous notes on everyone and everything in her life, she gave an explanation that made you feel sympathy for her: she said her father had taught her as a little girl to keep a hidden journal so she could survive her abusers and beat them in court.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=58,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=672.271,["end"]=677.454,["text"]="I gave Angela a microphone in my rooms whenever she wanted one.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=58,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=677.454,["end"]=690.413,["text"]="I spent hours talking with her offline, helped her look for family records, and started building a website for her so she'd have a place to lay out her research.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=59,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=690.713,["end"]=695.498,["text"]="In those rooms, other hosts heard things they valued in Angela.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=59,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=695.498,["end"]=701.153,["text"]="Here is Mellow Demon describing how he saw her during one long conversation.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=61,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=710.733,["end"]=717.444,["text"]="Later in that same room, Angela talked about forgiveness, making mistakes, and holding yourself accountable.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=63,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=756.724,["end"]=762.219,["text"]="At the time, those did not sound like empty words to me.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=64,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=762.519,["end"]=772.393,["text"]="In February 2026, Angela went out of her way on live broadcasts to praise my Spaces as open, respectful, and free of drama:",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=66,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=798.173,["end"]=809.106,["text"]="In a different February-tagged room, two women were angry that Angela would not label Mellow Demon a pedophile over an AI-generated image involving baby Jesus.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=66,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=809.106,["end"]=813.56,["text"]="Angela described the danger of labeling innocent people without enough evidence.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=66,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=813.56,["end"]=815.99,["text"]="The dispute was not about me.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=68,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=842.17,["end"]=857.8,["text"]="In another archived recording titled Space #1000, Angela told the audience that she trusted me so much she had given me the names of two military witnesses as her \"contingency\" in case anything ever happened to her.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=71,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=899.16,["end"]=904.575,["text"]="\"But you gotta stop telling people that I have the stuff because—\"",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=72,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=904.875,["end"]=907.127,["text"]="\"It defeats the purpose.\"",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=74,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=908.176,["end"]=910.833,["text"]="\"I would never do that.\"",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=75,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=911.134,["end"]=917.519,["text"]="What I remember is that Angela was comfortable saying I held sensitive information for her.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=75,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 1: A PLACE TO TELL YOUR STORY",["start"]=917.519,["end"]=926.033,["text"]="We trusted each other enough to talk privately, in ways I did not expect would become material for public arguments.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=77,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=948.137,["end"]=956.064,["text"]="By the spring of 2026, Sav had become part of the same circle of friends I was in.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=78,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=956.364,["end"]=963.075,["text"]="In May, she was going through a difficult separation and facing eviction with her children.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=79,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=963.375,["end"]=968.207,["text"]="Another host named Shane and I organized a marathon charity Space.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=79,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=968.207,["end"]=972.599,["text"]="Together, we raised $400 to help Sav keep her home.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=80,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=972.899,["end"]=974.734,["text"]="She was incredibly grateful.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=80,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=974.734,["end"]=979.322,["text"]="That night, she messaged Angela about the help she'd received.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=80,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=979.322,["end"]=986.662,["text"]="The following day, she thanked Angela for bringing her into the community where she'd met me.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=81,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=986.962,["end"]=991.646,["text"]="At that point, Angela was someone both of us trusted.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=82,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=991.946,["end"]=994.629,["text"]="We shared personal things with her.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=82,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=994.629,["end"]=999.548,["text"]="Things we never expected to become part of a public argument.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=83,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=999.848,["end"]=1014.235,["text"]="During our friendship, when someone online tried to dig into my past, I confided in Angela about a painful breakup I'd gone through two years earlier in Mississippi with an ex-girlfriend named Natalie.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=83,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1014.235,["end"]=1016.774,["text"]="Angela listened like a caring friend.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=84,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1017.074,["end"]=1025.174,["text"]="After the friendship broke down, Angela said in a confrontation that she had spoken with Natalie, my former partner.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=84,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1025.174,["end"]=1031.568,["text"]="I cannot establish from that sentence what Natalie told her, or how contact was made.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=85,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1031.868,["end"]=1038.529,["text"]="The recording replayed in the Fan Club Space cuts an important part of the original sentence.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=85,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1038.529,["end"]=1043.524,["text"]="Here is the first-generation Deacon conversation, with the missing context restored.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=86,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1043.823,["end"]=1051.507,["text"]="She said she had talked with Natalie and connected that to what she was setting up for court.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=86,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1051.507,["end"]=1057.911,["text"]="That is not proof she secretly tracked anybody down or proof of what Natalie said.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=87,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1058.212,["end"]=1065.229,["text"]="There is another conversation with Sav in which two of Angela’s statements are worth hearing together.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=87,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1065.229,["end"]=1066.545,["text"]="First, this promise:",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=88,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1066.845,["end"]=1072.26,["text"]="A little later, Angela said this about sharing her recordings with Sav:",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=90,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1096.359,["end"]=1098.259,["text"]="A liability.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=91,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1098.559,["end"]=1102.562,["text"]="This was a woman Angela had called her friend.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=91,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1102.562,["end"]=1106.566,["text"]="Someone who had trusted her with deeply personal information.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=92,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1106.867,["end"]=1113.983,["text"]="And here was Angela, describing that friend's emotional involvement as a liability to her investigation.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=93,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1114.283,["end"]=1117.773,["text"]="Maybe Angela saw that as a necessary boundary.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=93,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1117.773,["end"]=1124.317,["text"]="But listen to how differently she spoke about their friendship once loyalties began to change.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=94,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1124.618,["end"]=1132.545,["text"]="Because soon, some of the things Sav had told her in private would become everybody else's business.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=95,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1132.845,["end"]=1146.711,["text"]="And when you examine what Angela was admitting on tape across other broadcasts that winter, you see that her habit of investigating the people around her didn't start when a friendship ended.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=95,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT I — SCENE 2: THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=1146.711,["end"]=1150.177,["text"]="It started before the first conversation even began.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=96,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1151.476,["end"]=1156.345,["text"]="Angela often said that writing things down had helped her survive.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=96,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1156.345,["end"]=1164.754,["text"]="It's not hard to understand why a record could matter to somebody whose account of abuse might be doubted.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=97,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1165.054,["end"]=1170.143,["text"]="But she also described gathering information about people before confronting them.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=98,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1170.443,["end"]=1178.127,["text"]="In an archived room called Haunted Hump Day, a conversation about a possible lawsuit takes an unexpected turn.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=98,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1178.127,["end"]=1184.531,["text"]="Another speaker hears what Angela has already collected, and stops to ask her about it.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=103,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1206.472,["end"]=1209.145,["text"]="Hear the shift in that exchange.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=103,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1209.145,["end"]=1216.271,["text"]="Angela talks about protecting her legal options; then she talks about finding missing or adopted people.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=103,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1216.271,["end"]=1224.289,["text"]="Helping somebody find a relative isn't the same thing as collecting an opponent's address for a potential lawsuit.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=104,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1224.589,["end"]=1235.354,["text"]="But both explanations come after her admission that she'd obtained this particular person's address, phone number and other personal information before their confrontation.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=105,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1235.654,["end"]=1238.976,["text"]="So who else was she collecting information about?",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=105,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1238.976,["end"]=1246.451,["text"]="In other rooms she described running regional social-media groups where people traded relationship histories and identifying details.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=105,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1246.451,["end"]=1251.849,["text"]="She said those groups gave her access to a great deal of information.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=108,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1298.909,["end"]=1306.431,["text"]="She also described a categorized list of people in the X Spaces community she was actively examining.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=110,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1322.611,["end"]=1324.77,["text"]="Lists and records are tools.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=110,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1324.77,["end"]=1327.36,["text"]="Their existence does not prove abuse.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=110,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1327.36,["end"]=1335.563,["text"]="The questions become more troubling when somebody explains how much they keep back and when they might release it.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=111,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1335.863,["end"]=1345.412,["text"]="Listen to two statements from archived conversations, one about the information in her possession, the other about screenshots saved for another day.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=114,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1382.072,["end"]=1386.037,["text"]="That distinction matters to anyone who ever trusted her.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=114,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1386.037,["end"]=1390.002,["text"]="You can control what you say to a stranger.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=114,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1390.002,["end"]=1397.051,["text"]="You have much less control over information you've already given to someone you considered a friend.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=115,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1397.352,["end"]=1402.475,["text"]="And private screenshots were only one part of the system she described.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=115,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1402.475,["end"]=1411.44,["text"]="In other recordings from that period, Angela talked about provoking lawsuits because civil discovery could give her access to more records.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=116,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1411.74,["end"]=1413.992,["text"]="Listen to her reasoning.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=119,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1465.752,["end"]=1474.49,["text"]="That is Angela describing a proposed legal tactic, not proof that a court granted her access to anybody's records.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=120,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1474.79,["end"]=1485.15,["text"]="But across these conversations, the same feature keeps appearing: collecting information early, keeping some of it private, and deciding later when to use it.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=121,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1485.449,["end"]=1493.782,["text"]="In September, as friendships were already falling apart, Angela put the value of daily documentation into even simpler terms.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=125,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1540.722,["end"]=1544.168,["text"]="What concerned me wasn't that Angela took notes.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=125,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1544.168,["end"]=1559.675,["text"]="It was the possibility raised by people who knew her: that the notes did not stay a record of what had happened, but became something they feared she could use if they fell out with her.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=126,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 3: WHAT SHE KEPT",["start"]=1559.975,["end"]=1565.47,["text"]="And several former friends were willing to describe that fear on tape.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=127,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1566.27,["end"]=1570.954,["text"]="The first person I want you to hear is Sine.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=128,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1571.254,["end"]=1575.528,["text"]="In his rooms, people talked about trafficking, trauma and abuse.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=128,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1575.528,["end"]=1580.229,["text"]="Some of them were already carrying serious wounds when they arrived.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=128,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1580.229,["end"]=1586.639,["text"]="Sine says he believed Angela could help those people, so he sent them to her.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=129,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1586.939,["end"]=1593.118,["text"]="He did not come on the microphone to boast that he'd figured Angela out.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=129,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1593.118,["end"]=1600.622,["text"]="He sounded like somebody realizing that a referral made in good faith might have had terrible consequences.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=131,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1635.702,["end"]=1642.178,["text"]="Sine had sent people to Angela because he believed they would be safe with her.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=131,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1642.178,["end"]=1647.358,["text"]="Now he was wondering whether his referrals had put them at risk.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=132,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1647.658,["end"]=1664.646,["text"]="As I listened to former friends describing these conflicts, I had to keep one thing clear: for most of the calls to relatives, child-protection visits and alleged legal consequences, I don't have the original agency files or phone records.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=132,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1664.646,["end"]=1670.167,["text"]="These are personal accounts, many from people who were already angry with Angela.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=132,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1670.167,["end"]=1673.989,["text"]="They're not all independent proof of what she did.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=133,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1674.288,["end"]=1683.026,["text"]="But they do tell us what the people who trusted her say they experienced—and how those friendships broke apart.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=134,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1683.326,["end"]=1691.659,["text"]="Cambian describes one of those turning points: the moment he says Angela's praise became a demand for loyalty.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=136,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1788.679,["end"]=1793.672,["text"]="What Cambian describes is a shift in the rules of friendship.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=136,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1793.672,["end"]=1796.849,["text"]="Agree with Angela and you're an ally.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=136,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1796.849,["end"]=1803.658,["text"]="Refuse to join a campaign and, in his account, you're suddenly part of the enemy.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=137,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1803.958,["end"]=1809.047,["text"]="Other former friends described the consequences extending well beyond a microphone.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=138,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1809.348,["end"]=1815.287,["text"]="Peach was a mother in a group that included Angela, Timmy and Glow Baby.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=138,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1815.287,["end"]=1819.105,["text"]="They say she was struggling when the friendships fractured.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=138,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1819.105,["end"]=1827.165,["text"]="They also say Angela demanded that Peach choose sides, and that calls to her family and welfare checks followed.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=139,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1827.465,["end"]=1832.544,["text"]="Glow Baby believed those calls were a way to exert pressure.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=139,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1832.544,["end"]=1839.932,["text"]="Angela's stated concern for a person's safety is a competing explanation we have to take seriously.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=140,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1840.232,["end"]=1844.105,["text"]="Here is how Glow Baby described what happened.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=142,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=1999.495,["end"]=2005.12,["text"]="In Glow Baby's telling, the calls weren't the end of the friendship.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=142,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2005.12,["end"]=2010.746,["text"]="They were one of the ways the falling-out reached Peach's family.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=143,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2011.045,["end"]=2014.109,["text"]="Timmy was part of that circle too.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=143,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2014.109,["end"]=2020.674,["text"]="He alleged more serious things: private information being exposed, family contact, and calls to authorities.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=144,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2020.974,["end"]=2034.982,["text"]="But the thread that connects his account to the others is what he says Angela learned about survivors while they still trusted her—and what he believes happened after the friendships broke down.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=148,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2208.793,["end"]=2217.937,["text"]="That is Timmy's central allegation: getting close to survivors, learning their personal vulnerabilities, and later using what had been confided.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=149,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2218.236,["end"]=2224.136,["text"]="Glow Baby described what she says happened to her own family's information.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=152,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2292.856,["end"]=2296.049,["text"]="Another speaker offered a different vantage point.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=152,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2296.049,["end"]=2302.89,["text"]="Sian said he'd been physically present in Skittles' home during a Child Protective Services visit.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=153,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2303.191,["end"]=2307.075,["text"]="He had once spoken respectfully about Angela's mission.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=153,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2307.075,["end"]=2312.415,["text"]="Now he was watching an official visit unfold inside somebody's home.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=154,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2312.714,["end"]=2316.99,["text"]="He couldn't identify the caller from the visit itself.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=154,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2316.99,["end"]=2320.316,["text"]="But he could describe what he witnessed.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=156,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2366.916,["end"]=2376.465,["text"]="In the same September 18 broadcast, two women spoke about what they said had happened to them after falling out with Angela.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=157,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2376.765,["end"]=2385.909,["text"]="One described her legal name, phone number and residential property information being disclosed, and alleged that Angela had called her house.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=159,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2408.489,["end"]=2417.633,["text"]="Another mother said she'd faced repeated visits from child-protection workers and police, followed by calls to relatives, including her daughter.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=162,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2448.992,["end"]=2456.763,["text"]="Hear what those women describe: the phone ringing at home, visits from authorities, a daughter changing her number.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=162,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2456.763,["end"]=2460.648,["text"]="Their accounts put the online dispute inside real households.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=163,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2460.948,["end"]=2470.497,["text"]="Of course, an outside accusation doesn't prove who made any particular call, and a welfare check can arise from genuine concern.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=164,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2470.797,["end"]=2478.319,["text"]="So I went looking for the way Angela herself talked about intervening in other people's lives.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=165,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2478.619,["end"]=2487.776,["text"]="In another archived broadcast called Monkey Island, Angela described consequences she says followed phone calls she'd made about other people.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=165,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2487.776,["end"]=2491.897,["text"]="You'll hear me encouraging her just before she speaks.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=166,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2492.196,["end"]=2496.069,["text"]="Listen to the way Angela characterizes those consequences.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=167,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2496.37,["end"]=2500.649,["text"]="“A long line of destruction behind me for accountability.”",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=168,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2500.948,["end"]=2506.752,["text"]="I can't confirm the jail time or the confiscated firearms from this recording.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=168,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2506.752,["end"]=2513.449,["text"]="But I don't have to guess how Angela wanted the audience to understand her actions.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=168,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2513.449,["end"]=2518.36,["text"]="She used the word destruction herself—and placed it under accountability.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=169,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2518.66,["end"]=2522.765,["text"]="In another confrontation, she went beyond describing claimed consequences.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=169,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2522.765,["end"]=2528.694,["text"]="Somebody asked her directly whether she had helped disclose other people's private information.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=171,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=2561.274,["end"]=2563.174,["text"]="“I absolutely did.”",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.064,["decision"]="HUMAN STORY: light bed",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=172,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 4: THE PEOPLE WHO WENT TO HER FOR HELP",["start"]=25