on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=191,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 5: SAV'S WORST DAY",["start"]=2814.38,["end"]=2821.703,["text"]="On September 7, she named Sine and me while explaining why she believed others had failed her.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.068,["decision"]="RELATIONSHIP / HUMAN CONSEQUENCES: muted fragile cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=193,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 5: SAV'S WORST DAY",["start"]=2858.814,["end"]=2868.768,["text"]="The next day, on September 8, Angela began a broadcast in which she announced that she was going to post private relationship messages.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=194,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT II — SCENE 5: SAV'S WORST DAY",["start"]=2869.068,["end"]=2876.184,["text"]="And that is where the personal crisis Sav had described became part of something much bigger.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=195,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2877.484,["end"]=2884.049,["text"]="By the beginning of September, private conversations were already making their way into public Spaces.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=195,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2884.049,["end"]=2887.113,["text"]="And people were nervous about getting involved.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=196,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2887.413,["end"]=2890.422,["text"]="The Space was what the audience heard.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=196,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2890.422,["end"]=2899.88,["text"]="The back channels—private messages, group chats, and Discord rooms—were where people said things they never expected that audience to hear.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=197,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2900.18,["end"]=2905.455,["text"]="On September 2, I talked about screenshots I believed Angela had posted.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=197,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2905.455,["end"]=2908.532,["text"]="I asked another host to hide them.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=197,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2908.532,["end"]=2915.565,["text"]="He wouldn't—and the reason he gave says something about how powerful her reputation had become.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=198,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2915.865,["end"]=2927.036,["text"]="You'll hear his refusal described in my own words, followed by another speaker who starts to explain why he wanted no part of the conflict.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=201,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2964.195,["end"]=2968.394,["text"]="“Because they told her secrets and they can never—”",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=202,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2968.694,["end"]=2970.09,["text"]="He stops there.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=202,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2970.09,["end"]=2973.346,["text"]="The rest of that thought isn't recorded.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=202,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2973.346,["end"]=2977.998,["text"]="But the fear in the conversation is hard to miss.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=203,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2978.297,["end"]=2984.658,["text"]="By then, even other hosts were afraid of what might happen if they crossed Angela.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=203,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2984.658,["end"]=2994.412,["text"]="Six days later, something happened in my own room that Angela would use to explain why she was releasing even more private messages.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=204,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=2994.713,["end"]=3006.285,["text"]="On September 8, Oor—a man involved in a bitter feud with Angela—made a cruel remark about her deceased baby in a Space I was hosting.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=204,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3006.285,["end"]=3007.571,["text"]="Sav was listening.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=204,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3007.571,["end"]=3015.286,["text"]="According to her message to Angela, I immediately warned Oor to stop and removed him from the panel.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=204,["sentence_index"]=3,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3015.286,["end"]=3018.286,["text"]="Angela later acknowledged that I'd done so.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=205,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3018.585,["end"]=3020.792,["text"]="Nothing excuses what Oor said.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=205,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3020.792,["end"]=3032.268,["text"]="Yet Angela went on to cite what happened in my room when she announced a broadcast devoted to exposing private messages from Sav's and my relationship.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=206,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3032.568,["end"]=3034.868,["text"]="It was called Petty Space.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=206,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3034.868,["end"]=3038.548,["text"]="She was about to publish screenshots in batches.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=209,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3137.009,["end"]=3151.828,["text"]="Picture what that means for the person whose messages are being read: something said in a moment of insecurity or anger, which was never meant for strangers, now becoming the subject of a live broadcast.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=210,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3152.128,["end"]=3155.276,["text"]="Angela said she was exposing abusive behavior.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=210,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3155.276,["end"]=3157.524,["text"]="That was her public explanation.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=210,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3157.524,["end"]=3164.269,["text"]="Sav said she had confided those messages to a friend and didn't want them released.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=211,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3164.569,["end"]=3170.875,["text"]="Angela also described how she would keep more information in reserve until people responded.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=212,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3171.175,["end"]=3175.522,["text"]="This is what she said after one of the batches.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=212,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3175.522,["end"]=3178.13,["text"]="The laughter is directed at me.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=212,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3178.13,["end"]=3182.911,["text"]="But the private information making that moment possible came from Sav.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=214,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3199.991,["end"]=3206.702,["text"]="And as the broadcast continued, Angela warned the people listening that they were under investigation.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=217,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3263.962,["end"]=3267.895,["text"]="Angela gave more than one explanation for the disclosures.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=217,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3267.895,["end"]=3270.954,["text"]="One involved the insult in my room.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=217,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3270.954,["end"]=3274.887,["text"]="Another involved her claim that she was confronting abuse.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=218,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3275.187,["end"]=3286.763,["text"]="In a separate September 8 conversation, she said something I'd told her had triggered her, and that she had sent a screenshot to prove me wrong.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=219,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3287.063,["end"]=3290.125,["text"]="Listen to her describe that decision.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=221,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3333.005,["end"]=3336.473,["text"]="Taken together, those accounts describe an escalation.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=222,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3336.773,["end"]=3342.044,["text"]="First, Sav says private screenshots were shared against her wishes in August.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=222,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3342.044,["end"]=3351.267,["text"]="By September 2, I was already saying publicly that Angela had posted screenshots, though that recording doesn't identify precisely which ones.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=223,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3351.567,["end"]=3357.821,["text"]="Then, on September 8, Angela made the release itself the subject of a broadcast.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=223,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3357.821,["end"]=3363.628,["text"]="She announced batches of four and said she'd keep more messages in reserve.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=224,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3363.928,["end"]=3368.738,["text"]="We still can't reconstruct a single first disclosure from those accounts.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=224,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3368.738,["end"]=3379.233,["text"]="But we can hear the progression from a private breach of trust to a public campaign, and the explanations Angela gave along the way.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=225,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3379.533,["end"]=3387.055,["text"]="There was one more warning in Petty Space about just how far she was prepared to go.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=227,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3405.659,["end"]=3416.83,["text"]="That is an extraordinary amount of leverage for someone to hold over former friends: years of direct messages, waiting to be published if the argument escalates.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=228,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3417.129,["end"]=3422.741,["text"]="And the screenshots were not the only way the private relationship became public.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=228,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 6: PRIVATE MESSAGES, PUBLIC AUDIENCES",["start"]=3422.741,["end"]=3428.785,["text"]="Angela was also beginning to describe me in terms that could ruin a reputation.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=229,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3429.585,["end"]=3434.516,["text"]="Angela accused me of abusing women and called me a predator.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=229,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3434.516,["end"]=3441.241,["text"]="She also accused me of passing around women's nude photographs and creating sexual AI material.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=230,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3441.541,["end"]=3446.649,["text"]="I want to examine those claims because the consequences reached beyond me.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=230,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3446.649,["end"]=3456.44,["text"]="Sav had shared private concerns with Angela about our relationship; now those conversations were being used in the public case Angela was making.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=231,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3456.741,["end"]=3466.082,["text"]="Earlier, in an unrelated February dispute about Mellow Demon and an AI image, you heard Angela warn against a male witch hunt.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=231,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3466.082,["end"]=3472.451,["text"]="She said serious labels should be reserved for real abusers, not used to settle scores.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=232,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3472.751,["end"]=3480.167,["text"]="Months later, on September 7, she explained why she sometimes chose the word predator instead of pedophile.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=232,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3480.167,["end"]=3482.785,["text"]="The distinction she drew was deliberate.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=234,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3565.595,["end"]=3571.495,["text"]="Eleven days later, in Logan Black Unmasked, the language was directed at me.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=236,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3578.165,["end"]=3583.955,["text"]="An accusation that serious has consequences even before anyone knows whether it's supported.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=236,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3583.955,["end"]=3595.091,["text"]="Angela's description of choosing the word for legal purposes tells us how she approached the language; it does not establish that the label was accurate.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.07,["decision"]="PUBLIC CONFRONTATION: low restrained cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=237,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT III — SCENE 7: THE ACCUSATIONS AND THE CONFIDANTE",["start"]=3595