; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=289,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4143.015,["end"]=4147.294,["text"]="But by September, the relationship was disintegrating in public.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.068,["decision"]="RELATIONSHIP / HUMAN CONSEQUENCES: muted fragile cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=290,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4147.593,["end"]=4155.926,["text"]="On September 16, Angela described what she could do with private screenshots belonging to people who sided with me.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=292,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4171.206,["end"]=4179.133,["text"]="In another recorded confrontation, Angela defended her decision to request the police welfare check at Sav's home.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=293,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4179.433,["end"]=4180.801,["text"]="Her explanation matters.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.068,["decision"]="RELATIONSHIP / HUMAN CONSEQUENCES: muted fragile cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=293,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4180.801,["end"]=4189.467,["text"]="She said she feared for Sav's safety, understood that the call might end their friendship, and made it anyway.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory m