index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4209.122,["end"]=4218.038,["text"]="What did it mean to protect somebody when the most intimate details of their crisis could later enter an escalating argument?",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.068,["decision"]="RELATIONSHIP / HUMAN CONSEQUENCES: muted fragile cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=297,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4218.338,["end"]=4220.899,["text"]="On September 18, Sav spoke publicly.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=297,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4220.899,["end"]=4232.426,["text"]="She acknowledged her own insecurity and involvement in private gossip, but she also asked listeners to understand what it felt like to have her personal life exposed.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=298,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4232.726,["end"]=4239.032,["text"]="After so many people had talked about her, it matters to hear her uninterrupted.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.068,["decision"]="RELATIONSHIP / HUMAN CONSEQUENCES: muted fragile cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=300,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4389.212,["end"]=4397.95,["text"]="That is Sav describing how people caught up in an online conflict ended up carrying consequences in their real lives.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=301,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4398.25,["end"]=4405.947,["text"]="Then on September 30, Angela hosted a Space about the social cost of taking a suicide threat seriously.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=301,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4405.947,["end"]=4411.933,["text"]="She spoke about the possibility that authorities or family members might encounter the messages.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=303,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4418.513,["end"]=4421.17,["text"]="That is her public position.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.068,["decision"]="RELATIONSHIP / HUMAN CONSEQUENCES: muted fragile cue",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=304,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 9: WHAT IT MEANT TO HELP",["start"]=4421.47,["end"]=4435.073,["text"]="What appeared in a later private group chat needs to be considered separately, because those messages went further—and the identity of the person operating the account has not been independently confirmed.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=305,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4435.873,["end"]=4442.584,["text"]="The 