 snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=308,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4471.741,["end"]=4482.506,["text"]="At 6:35 in the morning, the labelled account discussed a recording of Sav while she was in distress, with her children in the background.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=309,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4482.806,["end"]=4501.95,["text"]="\"And first and foremost, I have you talking about killing yourself on recording with your kids screaming in the background and you’re sitting here trying to intimidate me and trying to make me not feel bad for teaching you that every action has a reaction.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=309,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4501.95,["end"]=4508.757,["text"]="If you want me to hold the fuck back, shut the fuck up, you dumb bitch.\"",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=310,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4509.058,["end"]=4516.448,["text"]="\"I’m not canceling anything do you understand and when c p s gets hold of that video?",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=310,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4516.448,["end"]=4522.968,["text"]="Because of the proper mandatory reporter that I sent it to, that’s not my issue.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=310,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4522.968,["end"]=4523.837,["text"]="Fuck off\"",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=311,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4524.136,["end"]=4535.111,["text"]="\"And I don’t give a fuck if you can’t afford to pay the damages, I just want you under the stress that you’ve caused me.\"",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=312,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4535.411,["end"]=4539.252,["text"]="There are two different things happening in those messages.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=312,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4539.252,["end"]=4544.8,["text"]="The discussion of a video and Child Protective Services appears in one exchange.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=312,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4544.8,["end"]=4551.201,["text"]="The line about wanting someone under stress appears in a separate discussion of civil damages.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=313,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4551.501,["end"]=4558.366,["text"]="We cannot fairly take that line about damages as proof that anybody planned to misuse CPS.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=313,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4558.366,["end"]=4564.373,["text"]="And the messages, however disturbing, do not themselves establish that a report was made.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=314,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4564.673,["end"]=4568.135,["text"]="But the earlier words raise a serious question.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=314,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4568.135,["end"]=4575.924,["text"]="A private crisis involving Sav and her children was being discussed as material that could reach outside authorities.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=315,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4576.224,["end"]=4584.404,["text"]="At 6:50, Sav's side of the chat accused Angela of threatening to send information to her parents.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=315,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4584.404,["end"]=4590.312,["text"]="The reply from the account labelled Angela's Spaces Alt reads like a warning.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=316,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4590.612,["end"]=4595.714,["text"]="\"Send it to my parents Angela like you threatened ya loser\"",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=317,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4596.014,["end"]=4597.35,["text"]="\"Maybe I should.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=317,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4597.35,["end"]=4600.468,["text"]="Maybe I should stop talking about it.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=317,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4600.468,["end"]=4603.14,["text"]="And just be about it, right?",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=317,["sentence_index"]=3,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4603.14,["end"]=4607.149,["text"]="That’s the only way you’re gonna learn a lesson\"",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WRITTEN MESSAGE — performative reading should stay dry, attribution audible",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=318,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4607.449,["end"]=4616.187,["text"]="Those screenshots don't prove who authored the account's reply or whether anyone contacted Sav's parents that morning.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=319,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4616.487,["end"]=4622.815,["text"]="But Sav provided a separate written account of what she says happened outside the app.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=319,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4622.815,["end"]=4628.299,["text"]="She named her ex, her father