",["start"]=4651.099,["end"]=4655.582,["text"]="She was already navigating a separation and questions of custody.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.055,["decision"]="NEUTRAL SCORING: near-subconscious investigative texture",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=321,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4655.582,["end"]=4662.755,["text"]="Sav says the contacts also raised accusations that she wasn't fit to care for her children.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=322,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4663.055,["end"]=4668.028,["text"]="I haven't independently confirmed each call or the messages passed along.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=322,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4668.028,["end"]=4671.644,["text"]="These are Sav's descriptions of what she experienced.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=322,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4671.644,["end"]=4682.494,["text"]="But the consequences she's describing are painfully specific: the possible loss of family support, and fear over how the accusations might affect her children.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=323,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4682.794,["end"]=4689.495,["text"]="I remember how shaken Sav sounded when we spoke on the phone around that period.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=323,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4689.495,["end"]=4694.855,["text"]="That's my recollection, not another recorded call I can play for you.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=325,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4695.655,["end"]=4706.565,["text"]="If Sav's account is accurate, the stakes of confiding in Angela were no longer just whether a screenshot would be posted in a public room.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=325,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4706.565,["end"]=4711.365,["text"]="They extended to the people Sav relied on outside the internet.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=326,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="ACT IV — SCENE 10: THE MONDAY MORNING MESSAGES",["start"]=4711.665,["end"]=4726.484,["text"]="And that is the part of this story I find hardest to dismiss: the very circumstances that made people seek somebody's help could, after a falling-out, become the details they most feared being exposed.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.062,["decision"]="CONFLICT: low harmonic pressure; leave allegations audible and contextual",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=328,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4727.285,["end"]=4731.158,["text"]="Think about the people who entered this story.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=329,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4731.458,["end"]=4735.362,["text"]="Sine believed he was sending survivors to an advocate.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=329,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4735.362,["end"]=4742.303,["text"]="Later, he said he feared he had been directing them toward someone who would target them.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=330,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4742.603,["end"]=4751.631,["text"]="Glow Baby and Timmy described friendships that, in their telling, led to threats and private family information being used in disputes.",["bed"]="silence",["gain"]=0,["decision"]="WITHHOLD MUSIC: sensitive account needs unforced space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=330,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4751.631,["end"]=4755.07,["text"]="Some of those claims still lack independent corroboration.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=331,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4755.37,["end"]=4764.266,["text"]="Sav believed she had a friend she could be honest with about motherhood, insecurity and a life that was coming apart.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=331,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4764.266,["end"]=4771.891,["text"]="Then she heard private details from that life recast in public, and said the conflict reached her family.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=332,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4772.191,["end"]=4774.091,["text"]="And Angela?",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=333,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4774.391,["end"]=4786.778,["text"]="In her own recordings, she described gathering information before approaching people, saving screenshots, keeping names and documents in reserve, and helping expose information when she believed she was justified.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=334,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4787.077,["end"]=4789.808,["text"]="She also said there were limits.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=334,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4789.808,["end"]=4794.816,["text"]="She said you shouldn't release something just to twist the knife.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=334,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4794.816,["end"]=4798.002,["text"]="She said some evidence could be weaponized.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=335,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4798.302,["end"]=4803.797,["text"]="Then she described the point where she decided to release it anyway.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=336,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4804.097,["end"]=4807.238,["text"]="I can't tell you everything Angela believed.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=336,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4807.238,["end"]=4812.622,["text"]="I can't turn every accusation made about her into an established fact.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=336,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4812.622,["end"]=4820.698,["text"]="But I can put the explanations she gave beside what the people who trusted her say they experienced.",["bed"]="human",["gain"]=0.075,["decision"]="HUMAN: restrained felt-piano memory motif",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=337,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4820.998,["end"]=4824.124,["text"]="That was the promise of this investigation.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=337,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4824.124,["end"]=4827.697,["text"]="Not that a microphone can read somebody's mind.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=337,["sentence_index"]=2,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4827.697,["end"]=4833.95,["text"]="That the words people choose—and the consequences others describe—can be heard together.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=338,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4834.25,["end"]=4837.712,["text"]="Angela once invited listeners to do exactly that.",["bed"]="investigation",["gain"]=0.09,["decision"]="INVESTIGATION: low unresolved fragment with dialogue space",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=338,["sentence_index"]=1,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4837.712,["end"]=4845.501,["text"]="To believe the good things they heard about her, and the bad, and make up their own minds.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"},{["cue_index"]=339,["sentence_index"]=0,["section"]="EPILOGUE — THE PAPER TRAIL",["start"]=4845.801,["end"]=4849.269,["text"]="I'll leave you with her invitation.",["bed"]="motif",["gain"]=0.078,["decision"]="EPILOGUE: signature motif returns with a different meaning",["timing"]="provisional based on manuscript and guide; must snap to recorded voice"}},["source_tracks"]={["motif"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCORE_Unsent_Fourth_Note.wav",["investigation"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCORE_Archive_Breathes.wav",["human"]="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCORE_What_Trust_Cost.wav"},["project_length"]=4890.149}